WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
<v Ada>Thanks for joining everyone, I know
the schedule is tight this week.</v>

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
<v Ada>First item is the export rewrite.</v>

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.103
<v Ada>We shipped the new splitter
on Monday and the captions</v>

00:00:17.103 --> 00:00:20.667
